      "writtenOn": "2020-11-10T00:13:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm.. probably nothing.  I guess I haven\u0027t got used to the ability to give a common data structure extra power, and not sure about the readability :)\n\nIf we prefer to do it that way, how would I specify the correct `len` to return in L96?  `slice::len(\u0026self)` doesn\u0027t seem to work.",
