      "message": "buf[..size].copy_from_slice(\u0026self.data.chunks(CHUNK_SIZE).skip(chunk_index).next()) or something along those lines? Then chunk_index_to_range can probably be inlined into the ChunkedFileReader code, simplifying things quite a bit. Just a thought. It may not be quite that simple given the final chunk will be a different size.",
      "revId": "b514af084df7131ecadfcb237c5fab252c6da4b0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
